msgid "I'm a student"
msgstr "Mimi ni mwanafunzi"

msgid "I'm an organization"
msgstr "Mimi ni shirika"

msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "Maswali"

msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr "Maswali yanayoulizwa mara kwa mara"

msgid "Does it cost anything to sign up?"
msgstr "Je, kujisajili kuna gharama?"

msgid "Can I get my fee back?"
msgstr "Je, naweza kurudishiwa ada yangu?"

msgid "Is my information safe?"
msgstr "Je, taarifa zangu ziko salama?"

msgid "Who can use IPT Marketplace?"
msgstr "Nani anaweza kutumia IPT Marketplace?"

msgid "Students at Tanzanian universities and colleges who are looking for an Industrial Practical Training placement, and organizations that offer training slots."
msgstr "Wanafunzi wa vyuo vikuu na vyuo vya Tanzania wanaotafuta nafasi ya Mafunzo kwa Vitendo ya Viwandani, na mashirika yanayotoa nafasi za mafunzo."

msgid "How do I pay?"
msgstr "Nalipaje?"

msgid "By mobile money (M-Pesa, Mixx by Yas or Airtel Money) from your application page, within 3 hours of applying."
msgstr "Kwa pesa za simu (M-Pesa, Mixx by Yas au Airtel Money) kupitia ukurasa wa ombi lako, ndani ya saa 3 baada ya kuomba."

msgid "What if I do not pay within 3 hours?"
msgstr "Nisipolipa ndani ya saa 3 itakuwaje?"

msgid "Your seat is released so that other students can apply for it."
msgstr "Nafasi yako hutolewa ili wanafunzi wengine waweze kuiomba."

msgid "Why do I need to verify my documents?"
msgstr "Kwa nini nahitaji kuthibitisha nyaraka zangu?"

msgid "Verification keeps the marketplace trustworthy. Students upload their student ID and details, and organizations submit their registration documents. Our team reviews them before approval."
msgstr "Uthibitisho unafanya soko liaminike. Wanafunzi hupakia kitambulisho na taarifa zao, na mashirika huwasilisha nyaraka zao za usajili. Timu yetu huzipitia kabla ya kuidhinisha."

msgid "When does an organization see my application?"
msgstr "Shirika linaona ombi langu lini?"

msgid "Only after your application fee is confirmed. This way organizations review serious, verified candidates."
msgstr "Baada tu ya ada yako ya maombi kuthibitishwa. Hivyo mashirika hupitia waombaji makini na waliothibitishwa."

msgid "Who can I contact for help?"
msgstr "Naweza kuwasiliana na nani kupata msaada?"

msgid "Use the WhatsApp button on this page, call 0787 196 911 or 0756 322 833, or email semauyatech@gmail.com."
msgstr "Tumia kitufe cha WhatsApp kwenye ukurasa huu, piga 0787 196 911 au 0756 322 833, au tuma barua pepe kwa semauyatech@gmail.com."

msgid "Creating an account is free. Students pay an application fee of TZS %(fee)s for each application."
msgstr "Kufungua akaunti ni bure. Wanafunzi hulipa ada ya maombi ya TZS %(fee)s kwa kila ombi."

msgid "Fees are non-refundable. Please read the <a href=\"%(url)s#payments\" class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\">payments and refund policy</a> in our Terms before you apply."
msgstr "Ada hazirudishwi. Tafadhali soma <a href=\"%(url)s#payments\" class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\">sera ya malipo na marejesho</a> kwenye Masharti yetu kabla ya kuomba."

msgid "Your documents are stored securely and only seen by our verification team. For your protection you are signed out after 10 minutes of inactivity. Read our <a href=\"%(url)s\" class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\">Privacy Policy</a> for details."
msgstr "Nyaraka zako huhifadhiwa kwa usalama na huonekana na timu yetu ya uthibitisho pekee. Kwa ulinzi wako, unatolewa kwenye akaunti baada ya dakika 10 za kutotumia. Soma <a href=\"%(url)s\" class=\"text-primary font-semibold hover:underline\">Sera ya Faragha</a> kwa maelezo zaidi."

